---
title: "Where does the checking close live?"
accTitle: "Period note placement of the Wells Fargo checking closing balance"
accDescr: "Daily notes keep only the Bank Badge. Period notes add a closing readout in the existing Bank Period Charts header after the stats strip and badge."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 14
    nodeSpacing: 18
    wrappingWidth: 260
---
flowchart TD
  subgraph DAILY["Daily note"]
    direction TB
    DS["`**Day strip**`"]
    DB["`**Bank Badge**<br/>In / Out flow`"]
    DS --> DB
  end
  subgraph PERIOD["Period note"]
    direction TB
    PS["`**Stats strip**`"]
    PB["`**Bank Badge**<br/>In / Out flow`"]
    HDR["`**BANK CHARTS header**`"]
    CL["`**Closing readout**<br/>WF Checking stock`"]
    PL["`**Cashflow and Out charts**`"]
    PS --> PB
    PB --> HDR
    HDR --> CL
    HDR --> PL
  end
  classDef muted fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6B7280,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1F2937
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  class DS,DB,PS,PB,HDR,PL muted
  class CL outcome
  style DAILY fill:none,stroke:#6B7280
  style PERIOD fill:none,stroke:#3B78C2
